><span>Feedback &amp; Complaints</span></h3><div appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"tile-des\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Share your feedback or submit a complaint.</span><!----></div></div></div><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayoutalign=\"end center\" class=\"tile-footer\"><span fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayoutalign=\"center center\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"tile-icon circle\" aria-label=\" Feedback &amp; Complaints\"><img aria-hidden=\"true\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Support/HelpSupport/arrow.ashx?h=48&amp;iar=0&amp;w=48&amp;rev=6c22fb7889b7443a9162b149e8f9b560&amp;hash=3508278044DF70DEE2B4BCCDD40B238C\" alt=\"arrow\"></span></div></div></a></li><!----></ul><!----></section></app-jss-tiles><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"flex-col ng-star-inserted\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View popular Frequently Asked Questions\">Popular FAQs</h2><!----><div class=\"all-faqs ng-star-inserted\"><a id=\"viewAllFaq\" class=\"faq_link_button ng-star-inserted\" target=\"_self\" href=\"/en-SA/Support/HelpAndSupport/FAQs\n                  \" aria-label=\"View all Frequently Asked Questions\"><span> View all FAQs </span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined faq_icon icon-Link_chevron\"> chevron_right </span></a><!----></div><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-27 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-28 ng-tns-c1859850774-27 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I rebook my reward/reward+ ticket?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-28\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-28\"> Can I rebook my reward/reward+ ticket? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-28 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-27 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-27\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>AlFursan reward tickets can be rebooked with the following conditions:</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>New flight must be in the same category i.e. a Reward ticket can be rebooked as another Reward ticket only. Reward+ ticket can only be rebooked as a Reward+ ticket.</li>\n    <li>Members will incur a small fee when rebooking a reward ticket:<br>\n    <strong><br>\n    Rebooked fee:<br>\n    </strong><strong><br>\n    International:</strong><br>\n    - Adult 250 SAR<br>\n    - Infant 25 SAR<br>\n    <strong><br>\n    Domestic:<br>\n    </strong>- Adult 100 SAR<br>\n    - Infant 10 SAR</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-29 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-30 ng-tns-c1859850774-29 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How can I refund my ticket?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-30\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-30\"> How can I refund my ticket? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-30 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-29 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-29\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>You can refund you ticket through <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/en-SA/travel-with-saudia/manage/refund\">refund.saudia.com</a> or through one of Saudia city ticketing offices or telephone call centers.</p>\n<p>Please visit  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/en-SA/before-flying/travel-information/fare-rules\">Saudia Packages</a> page.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-31 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-32 ng-tns-c1859850774-31 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How can I transfer the ticket amount into my wallet account?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-11\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-11\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-32\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-32\"> How can I transfer the ticket amount into my wallet account? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-32 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-31 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-11\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-11\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-31\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">You can go to Manage Booking in GovClick webpage and proceed with the option \"Cancel trip\".<br>\nThe tickets issued using GovClick will be refunded back to your wallet directly.<br>\nThe tickets issued though Government Travel Order will be transferred to a voucher starts with 115 which you can add to your wallet later.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-33 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-34 ng-tns-c1859850774-33 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I modify my reservation after I issued it using my wallet?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-12\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-12\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-34\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-34\"> Can I modify my reservation after I issued it using my wallet? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-34 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-33 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-12\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-12\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-33\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">You can rebook your flights currently by changing the dates only, If you need to change the route or the class please cancel the ticket and book a new ticket</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"flex-col ng-star-inserted\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image-link-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"custom-carousel h--right image--teaser mobile-text--top ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div appswiper=\"\" fxflex=\"auto\" class=\"swiper-container ng-star-inserted swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-backface-hidden\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide ng-star-inserted swiper-slide-active\"><div fxlayout=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"\" fxflexfill=\"\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swiper-slide__image desktop-view ng-star-inserted\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" alt=\"Desktop Banner\" width=\"3600\" height=\"660\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Support/HelpSupport/WWOBanner.ashx?h=660&amp;iar=0&amp;w=3600&amp;rev=d212993e53af4f3192afb8c0077b31e9&amp;hash=8BFCAB009E9C5962B7161D53D108CFB4\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"eea768b0-f5f7-4337-99a6-7dd75f581841\